Subject: [PATCH] server: --api-key-stdin on every route; no /load, page, static files or CORS

AIOS patch for whisper.cpp v1.9.5 (ADR 0016, M-19/SR-08).

Upstream whisper-server has no API key at all. This patch:
- adds --api-key-stdin: one key from the first line of stdin at start-up, the
  same way llama-server and backend.exe receive theirs. The flag carries no
  secret. The server refuses to start without it.
- checks "Authorization: Bearer <key>" on every route, /health included, and
  answers 401 otherwise (constant-time compare).
- removes POST /load (it loaded any model path it was given), the HTML page,
  the CORS preflight route and headers, and static file serving (--public).

Security-relevant: changes need the named technical reviewer.
